# Apple Silicon with 128 GB+ unified memory (Mac Studio / MacBook Pro M3-M5 Max 128 GB; Ultras land here too).
# Metal working set ~96 GiB (75%; an M3 Max 128 GB logs recommendedMaxWorkingSetSize = 103079.22 MB, i.e. 10^6-byte MB,
# which is exactly 96.0 GiB). Both resident:
# architect: gpt-oss-120b Derestricted (ArliAI norm-preserving biprojected ablation; UGI W/10 9.2, NatInt 35.70
#   against 33.68 for stock). The research picks gpt-oss-120b over Qwen3.8-27B as the 128 GB architect. It is also much faster
#   on Metal (MoE, 5.1B active: ~65 tok/s decode and ~2500 tok/s prefill at 32K on M5 Max, against 65 s TTFT at 32K for dense 27B).
#   59.0 GiB file, 58.5 GiB on the GPU + KV 128K 4.5 GiB (18 full-attention layers, 36 KiB/token f16) + ~1.5 compute = ~64.5 GiB
# coder: Qwen3.6-35B-A3B heretic i1-Q5_K_M 23.6 GiB + KV 128K 2.5 GiB + ~1.5 compute = ~27.6 GiB
# Together ~92 GiB of 96. Stock models (Qwen3.6 UD-Q5_K_M ~28.6 GiB, ggml-org gpt-oss-120b ~64.5 GiB) sit in their own
# exclusive group: they load one at a time and unload the uncensored pair first.
# A Q6_K coder (+3.6 GiB, ~95.7 GiB total) would leave no headroom under the 96 GiB limit. A Q6_K or Q8_0 coder
# needs a higher iogpu.wired_limit_mb.
# The architect thinks at --reasoning-effort high: it is meant for occasional plan/review calls.
PROFILE_DESC="Apple Silicon, 128 GB+ unified memory (gpt-oss-120b architect + Qwen3.6 coder resident)"

# alias=catalog_id@ctx[@extra llama-server args]
# Aliases are stable API model names; harness configs only ever reference aliases.
ULA_MODELS="
coder=qwen3.6-35b-a3b-heretic-q5km@131072
architect=gpt-oss-120b-derestricted-mxfp4@131072@--reasoning-effort high
coder-stock=qwen3.6-35b-a3b-q5km@131072
architect-stock=gpt-oss-120b-mxfp4@131072@--reasoning-effort high
embed=qwen3-embedding-0.6b-q8@8192@-ngl 0
rerank=qwen3-reranker-0.6b-q8@8192@-ngl 0
"
# Installed by default; the rest with `ula pull --all` or `install.sh --all-models`.
ULA_DEFAULT="coder architect embed rerank"

ULA_CODER=coder
ULA_ARCHITECT=architect
ULA_SWAP_LLMS=false         # false: coder and architect resident together
ULA_GPU_ARGS="-ngl 999"
ULA_CHAT_ARGS="--cache-ram 4096"   # per chat process; two of them run here
ULA_TTL=1800                # unload an idle chat model after 30 min
ULA_MIN_DISK_GIB=15
